        }
      }
    },
    "Estimated total latency to apps (not measured)": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Latence totale estimée jusqu'aux applications (non mesurée)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Estimates (Core Audio properties + latencies reported by plugins), not measurements.\nHeadphones: ≈ %@ ms · virtual output: ≈ %@ ms (including a %lld-sample buffer)\nBuffer: %lld samples (%@ ms) ×2\nHardware input: %lld samples · output: %lld samples\nPlugins: %@ ms\nThe engine → BlackHole offset is measured separately (Settings › Diagnostics).\nThe app receiving the sound (OBS, FaceTime…) adds its own latency.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Estimates (Core Audio properties + latencies reported by plugins), not measurements.\nHeadphones: ≈ %1$@ ms · virtual output: ≈ %2$@ ms (including a %3$lld-sample buffer)\nBuffer: %4$lld samples (%5$@ ms) ×2\nHardware input: %6$lld samples · output: %7$lld samples\nPlugins: %8$@ ms\nThe engine → BlackHole offset is measured separately (Settings › Diagnostics).\nThe app receiving the sound (OBS, FaceTime…) adds its own latency."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Estimations (propriétés Core Audio + latences déclarées des plugins), pas des mesures.\nCasque : ≈ %1$@ ms · sortie virtuelle : ≈ %2$@ ms (dont tampon %3$lld éch.)\nBuffer : %4$lld éch. (%5$@ ms) ×2\nMatériel entrée : %6$lld éch. · sortie : %7$lld éch.\nPlugins : %8$@ ms\nLe décalage moteur → BlackHole est mesuré séparément (Réglages › Diagnostic).\nL'application qui reçoit le son (OBS, FaceTime…) ajoute sa propre latence."
          }
        }
      }
    },
