    "VoxFlowAir does not have access to the microphone. Allow it in System Settings › Privacy & Security › Microphone, then restart the engine.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "VoxFlowAir n'a pas accès au micro. Autorisez-le dans Réglages Système › Confidentialité et sécurité › Microphone, puis relancez le moteur."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "VoxFlowAir driver %@ is installed but not yet loaded by macOS. Restart the Mac or run the installation again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pilote VoxFlowAir %@ installé mais pas encore chargé par macOS. Redémarrez le Mac ou relancez l'installation."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "VoxFlowAir is feeding it. In OBS, FaceTime… choose the “%@” microphone.": {
      "localizations": {
